OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, stabbed in shopping
OL,4,Acentre attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has been stabbed in a
OL,7,Fcar park at Manchester's Arndale Centre
OL,8,Fshopping mall.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police said the boy
OL,11,Fwas injured on the 9th floor of
OL,12,FManchester's Arndale Centre just after
OL,13,F15:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe force said his injuries were not
OL,16,Fbelieved to be life threatening or life
OL,17,Fchanging. The Arndale was closed for
OL,18,Fseveral hours after the stabbing.
OL,20,FDet Insp Sam Jones said: "This is
OL,21,Fbelieved to be an isolated incident
OL,22,Fwith no risk to the wider public."
